{"ID":"20260213110830-e0g7dxq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3c0","id":"20260213110830-e0g7dxq","tags":"YoLo框架,目标检测","title":"YoLoV5","type":"doc","updated":"20260306150454"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260213110830-5d7tu07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260213110830-5d7tu07","updated":"20260306092059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经过了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的学习之后，直接跳转到YoLoV5进行学习，这两个版本均是一个团队设计的，因此他们二者的连续性会强一些，同时V5版本应该是当年最先进的版本没有之一。"}]},{"ID":"20260306092059-lsbi679","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092059-lsbi679","updated":"20260306092149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"V5在V3上面经过了超级多的改进。但是他是没有论文这个东西的产出的，主要就是为了工程实践的。"}]},{"ID":"20260306092327-w6jy23s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092327-w6jy23s","updated":"20260306092341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个玩意儿有且仅有代码而已，只能看着代码来说一说了"}]},{"ID":"20260306093318-x4z4exe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260306093318-x4z4exe","updated":"20260306093318"}},{"ID":"20260306092150-72pq2pb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260306092150-72pq2pb","updated":"20260306093310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.网络整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260306092213-oh9iym9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092213-oh9iym9","updated":"20260306092443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该网络架构是非常典型的但阶段目标检测算法。"}]},{"ID":"20260306092556-ka54qrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092556-ka54qrm","updated":"20260306092613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从网络的代码架构中可以看出它的一些算法思路了"}]},{"ID":"20260306092613-25kc77u","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092613-25kc77u","updated":"20260306092828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092614-rpnxoqc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092614-rpnxoqc","updated":"20260306092614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092614-t8gwkjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092614-t8gwkjq","updated":"20260306092639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入端：Mosaic 增强、自适应锚框计算、自适应图片缩放(V3中已经提到了)。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092640-6w4j6vf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092640-6w4j6vf","updated":"20260306092640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092640-dl7684s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092640-dl7684s","updated":"20260306092730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基准网络：Focus 结构与 CSP 结构（C3 结构），SPP (SPPF)。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092718-ms4vgcp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092718-ms4vgcp","updated":"20260306092718"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092718-779wrhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092718-779wrhq","updated":"20260306092718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Neck 网络：采用 FPN+PAN 结构。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092736-ncy792q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092736-ncy792q","updated":"20260306092817"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092736-i684gc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092736-i684gc1","updated":"20260306092817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Head 输出层：分类 + 定位于一体。（分类、定位、目标检测都可以做，这里主要就是以目标检测的任务为主）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092741-6bm1woh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092741-6bm1woh","updated":"20260306092741"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092741-lm1s876","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092741-lm1s876","updated":"20260306092741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目标框回归。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092745-win670q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092745-win670q","updated":"20260306092828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092745-3l30etm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092745-3l30etm","updated":"20260306092828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正负样本匹配。（和V4是基本一样的）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092749-bapi0gi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306092749-bapi0gi","updated":"20260306092750"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306092749-fb1nzyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092749-fb1nzyw","updated":"20260306092750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"损失函数：分类损失 + 置信度损失 + 定位损失。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306092443-lkqb6dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306092443-lkqb6dq","updated":"20260306093306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 1000px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306093009-3tnoxt2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1000px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306093310-r6s7n5b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260306093310-r6s7n5b","updated":"20260306093310"}},{"ID":"20260306092116-3o3x2o9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260306092116-3o3x2o9","updated":"20260306093731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.网络输入端"}]},{"ID":"20260306093028-503td35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093028-503td35","updated":"20260306093731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.mosasic数据增强处理"}]},{"ID":"20260306093339-serit1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093339-serit1i","updated":"20260306093352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个东西之前yolov4就已经提到了。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093541-6w8gqmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093541-6w8gqmn","updated":"20260306093659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的方法是将多个图片，这里是四张图片，拼成一张全新的图片，来尽可能的丰富训练样本的多样性。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093701-ul1czr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093701-ul1czr1","updated":"20260306093709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306093659-452sy2a.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306093353-sbs8i7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093353-sbs8i7c","updated":"20260306093731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西主要是用来提高模型鲁棒性的。它是吧多个对象放在一张图片之中，就是把很多的图片并在一张图片之中。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093731-oxuzcfh","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260306093731-oxuzcfh","updated":"20260306093751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260306093734-550l5dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093734-550l5dt","updated":"20260306093751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说的很强，实际上就是最基本的数据增强的策略罢了"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306093041-7akcy0a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093041-7akcy0a","updated":"20260306094629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.自适应锚框计算"}]},{"ID":"20260306094024-vt65i6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094024-vt65i6u","updated":"20260306094105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个自适应锚框计算最早期的东西是产生在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中的。"}]},{"ID":"20260306094111-1y1lvxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094111-1y1lvxz","updated":"20260306094201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他是根据数据集的目标大小和比例，来比较自动的调整好锚框的大小，使得我们的锚框能够更好的适应当前的数据目标类型。"}]},{"ID":"20260306094254-8h7rt18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094254-8h7rt18","updated":"20260306094502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的YOLO系列在生成预设锚框的时候，其默认的框大小和尺寸是根据COCO数据集来设计的，并不一定可以满足我们自建的数据集，比如什么口罩检测呀，车牌检测呀，工业零件检测之类的任务，这些任务和COCO数据集的差距非常之大，框的匹配效果也是很差的，因此这里就想着搞一个自适应的玩意儿，能够根据数据集来实时获取最适合的锚框。"}]},{"ID":"20260306094503-ws59s5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094503-ws59s5t","updated":"20260306094513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的计算方式还是很基本的："}]},{"ID":"20260306094515-tzvnno4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306094515-tzvnno4","updated":"20260306094629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306094517-0mt3keg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306094517-0mt3keg","updated":"20260306094517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306094517-mwco9ko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094517-mwco9ko","updated":"20260306094529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统计我们的真实目标框框"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306094529-j6jniz3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306094529-j6jniz3","updated":"20260306094655"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306094529-5wzfjeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094529-5wzfjeg","updated":"20260306094655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用K-means聚类算法将这些宽高进行聚类，得到最好的几种类型的锚框。注意在计算的时候，使用的是IOU进行计算而非所谓的欧氏距离作为指标的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306094605-3om4zdj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306094605-3om4zdj","updated":"20260306094629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306094605-pgjp7mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094605-pgjp7mf","updated":"20260306094629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练过程之中默认就是这个框。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306093104-rbejuyt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093104-rbejuyt","updated":"20260306134841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.自适应图片缩放"}]},{"ID":"20260306094902-kvvhpge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094902-kvvhpge","updated":"20260306094948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西和之前的自适应锚框计算是两种完全不一样的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20260306094950-mhmhs9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306094950-mhmhs9b","updated":"20260306095013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个模型分为训练阶段和推理阶段"}]},{"ID":"20260306095139-0icuv5n","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260306095139-0icuv5n","updated":"20260306095144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart LR\n    A[输入参数X] --\u0026gt; B[经过模型前向传播]\n    B --\u0026gt; C[生成结果参数y]\n    C --\u0026gt; D[通过损失函数计算]\n    D --\u0026gt; E[求得当前损失]\n    E --\u0026gt; F[经过反向传播算法]\n    F --\u0026gt; G[进行权重的更新]"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260306095217-2jjguvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095217-2jjguvv","updated":"20260306095250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在训练阶段是啥都有的，但是推理阶段并不存在损失函数和反向传播的计算。"}]},{"ID":"20260306095255-bybc4q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095255-bybc4q3","updated":"20260306095408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说我们在计算的过程前，也就是输入阶段是会让我们的模型都完全统一到相同的图像尺寸大小进行输入。"}]},{"ID":"20260306095408-19gnmub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095408-19gnmub","updated":"20260306134841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306095420-tstr7ap.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"训练阶段"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306095427-psz03yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095427-psz03yd","updated":"20260306095508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此在输入的时候需要将图片尺寸进行调整，将他调整成合适的大小进行缩放。"}]},{"ID":"20260306095722-i2dl1nc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306095722-i2dl1nc","updated":"20260306095829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.1.训练阶段"}]},{"ID":"20260306095508-ubu6s9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095508-ubu6s9a","updated":"20260306095624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于上面这张图片总不能够直接拉伸处理把整张图片硬拉伸成目标大小把，防止这个狗变形。因此这里就采样了一种比较好的方式"}]},{"ID":"20260306095634-wutvi48","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-wutvi48","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-nob7ga1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-nob7ga1","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-7bcqdqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-7bcqdqq","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"计算长边缩放比例"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原图尺寸为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(523, 699)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，目标尺寸为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"416"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。长边为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"699"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，缩放比例：r"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"699416​≈0.5951"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306095634-r59b239","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-r59b239","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-05wzbbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-05wzbbl","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"等比例缩放原图"}]},{"ID":"20260306095634-ijznbqt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-ijznbqt","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-bi2i4sk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-bi2i4sk","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-wduaih2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-wduaih2","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宽度：523×0.5951≈311"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306095634-6s312rj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-6s312rj","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-3gb8m5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-3gb8m5q","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高度：699×0.5951≈416\n缩放后尺寸为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(311, 416)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，与图中一致。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306095634-5fguddw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-5fguddw","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306095634-uufdouo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095634-uufdouo","updated":"20260306095634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"填充到目标尺寸 (416, 416)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"416"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 已满足，需要填充宽度。总填充宽度：416−311"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"105上下（左右）各填充：pad"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2105"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"52.5这与图中计算结果一致。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306095650-td9at0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095650-td9at0s","updated":"20260306095808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后使用了那种灰度填充的方式很完美的在保证图像不失真的情况下，显著减少其计算量。"}]},{"ID":"20260306095826-389342n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306095826-389342n","updated":"20260306134846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.2.推理阶段"}]},{"ID":"20260306095838-xdqcy4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306095838-xdqcy4u","updated":"20260306134846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306095838-lthfqm6.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"推理阶段"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306100136-wf310oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100136-wf310oc","updated":"20260306100210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在推理阶段我们最重要的目的不再是图片的信息了，而是要求速度的块了，毕竟是一个验证的过程。"}]},{"ID":"20260306100210-fmmndcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100210-fmmndcq","updated":"20260306100323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们这里是不再存在目标尺寸了，而是一种动态的尺寸，因此他的缩放和填充策略为："}]},{"ID":"20260306100329-ofx7jk1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100329-ofx7jk1","updated":"20260306100352"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100352-kqkp2hn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100352-kqkp2hn","updated":"20260306100352"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100352-9exzvzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100352-9exzvzp","updated":"20260306100352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先按长边等比缩放；"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306100333-xwf988f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100333-xwf988f","updated":"20260306100356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100356-zfq883z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100356-zfq883z","updated":"20260306100356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100356-qeo3dm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100356-qeo3dm2","updated":"20260306100356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再将短边 padding 到最近的 32 的倍数；"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306100344-mchk3te","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100344-mchk3te","updated":"20260306100359"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100359-fcg6azk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306100359-fcg6azk","updated":"20260306100359"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306100359-dkjopua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100359-dkjopua","updated":"20260306100359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不做任何数据增强。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306100323-kzq43f6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306100323-kzq43f6","updated":"20260306132231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.3.总结一下"}]},{"ID":"20260306100409-2nik9dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100409-2nik9dt","updated":"20260306100510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在模型的训练阶段我们的目的是保证模型可以在数据集上学习到目标的不同特征，因此需要进行数据增强保证输入的尺寸完全一致，最小化整体的损失"}]},{"ID":"20260306100510-ogi30wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306100510-ogi30wu","updated":"20260306132231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而在模型的推理阶段，我们要尽可能的输出检测结果，主要考虑的是速度优化和内存占用的相关问题，因此完全没有必要让图片搞得完全一样的尺寸大小，只需要保证其中的短边为32的倍数即可。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093113-m9wponx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093113-m9wponx","updated":"20260306135318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.主干网络架构"}]},{"ID":"20260306132756-iiqbt6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132756-iiqbt6e","updated":"20260306132819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里可以说是主干部分，也是最主要的一个部分，因此需要详细说明一下。"}]},{"ID":"20260306132539-0nbjk1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132539-0nbjk1x","updated":"20260306132613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在说整体网络架构之前，需说一下，这里yoloV5使用的激活函数变成了SiLU激活函数了。"}]},{"ID":"20260306132626-r8puwmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132626-r8puwmz","updated":"20260306134855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306132626-tvpt28p.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"SiLU激活函数"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306132647-0ry3dsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132647-0ry3dsn","updated":"20260306132727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作者将激活函数从之前的ReLU激活函数变成了现在的SiLU激活函数了，他的函数图像如上图所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260306132920-4vkm8aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132920-4vkm8aq","updated":"20260306132927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在给出整个网络架构图片"}]},{"ID":"20260306132927-qdf4i3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132927-qdf4i3d","updated":"20260306132942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306132927-elfmi00.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"yolov5网络整体架构图"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306132944-n2wiw3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306132944-n2wiw3l","updated":"20260306133019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整个和之前的基本一致，也是从主干到颈部特征融合，以及最后的检测头部分"}]},{"ID":"20260306093119-azqmr55","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093119-azqmr55","updated":"20260306134040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1.Focus结构"}]},{"ID":"20260306133135-2i251o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133135-2i251o1","updated":"20260306133208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个模块和之前的Passthrough几乎差不多的感觉，先拆分后叠加的一个事情。"}]},{"ID":"20260306133444-3xci874","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306133444-3xci874","updated":"20260306133133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260306133121-51m9372","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133121-51m9372","updated":"20260306133133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 589px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306133131-amvxg0r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306133733-ov0w3he","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306133733-ov0w3he","updated":"20260306133807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260306133442-rt05bfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133442-rt05bfi","updated":"20260306133800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先输入一张假设大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"4\\times 4 \\times 8"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的图片，然后进行切分我们把这个图片中每一个通道的都拆开来一部分合成一组通道，最后会产生24个通道，也就是说我们经过focus操作之后得到的东西，特征图会变得小一点，但是他的通道数量会显著增加"}]},{"ID":"20260306133733-0jm6isk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133733-0jm6isk","updated":"20260306133807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306133739-3w2ni3r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306133824-aw3t8a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133824-aw3t8a5","updated":"20260306133836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是说他们的变化为"}]},{"ID":"20260306133839-erdnp5r","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306133839-erdnp5r","updated":"20260306133941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"H \\times W \\times C --\u003e \\frac{H}{2} \\times \\frac{W}{2} \\times (4C)"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306133948-65ewuci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306133948-65ewuci","updated":"20260306134040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这么处理一下他的参数量确实是减少了，相当于是在降低计算量的前提下降低了精度。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093128-kllluy9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093128-kllluy9","updated":"20260306135159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.CSP结构"}]},{"ID":"20260306134126-zcwqc2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134126-zcwqc2a","updated":"20260306134502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这里面最主要的就是其中的C3模块。但是C3模块总共存在两种不同的类型："}]},{"ID":"20260306134503-ma86wze","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134503-ma86wze","updated":"20260306134608"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134504-kxfx95c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134504-kxfx95c","updated":"20260306134600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134504-on5wjmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134504-on5wjmb","updated":"20260306134600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C3_1_X"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306134600-8r8t0re.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306134516-uvlkoup","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134516-uvlkoup","updated":"20260306134608"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134516-i0aa1tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134516-i0aa1tp","updated":"20260306134608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C3_2_X"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306134608-ui51wxx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306134526-ivtqocb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134526-ivtqocb","updated":"20260306135159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两种类型最主要的区别就是残差组件的不同，其中的x是表示残差组件的数量。"}]},{"ID":"20260306134615-78jlmr9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134615-78jlmr9","updated":"20260306134812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.1.最小的基本单元CBS"}]},{"ID":"20260306134633-oogltuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134633-oogltuk","updated":"20260306134717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在上面的网络架构之中可以看出，最主要的单元也就是CBS整个单元结构，这个单元和之前的CBL之类的完全类似，仅仅只是激活函数的修改罢了。"}]},{"ID":"20260306134151-rmiemre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134151-rmiemre","updated":"20260306134320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中的最小单元为CBS也就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Conv+BatchNorm+SiLU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是整个网络的最小单元，一个卷积操作加上一组批量池化操作，最后配合上一个SiLU激活函数的整体单元。"}]},{"ID":"20260306134721-fyaqhj4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134721-fyaqhj4","style":"text-align: center;","updated":"20260306134758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph LR\n\tConv --\u0026gt;BatchNorm\n\tBatchNorm --\u0026gt; SiLU\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260306134812-loyxqkl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134812-loyxqkl","updated":"20260306135242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.2.残差组件单元"}]},{"ID":"20260306134930-4ukakc0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134930-4ukakc0","updated":"20260306135024"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134932-eh1rfvp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134932-eh1rfvp","updated":"20260306135024"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134932-2nlgwo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134932-2nlgwo3","updated":"20260306135024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResUnit-T"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306135004-qsr1m5i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306134944-xd4og2k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260306134944-xd4og2k","updated":"20260306135015"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306134944-k4b6dfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134944-k4b6dfe","updated":"20260306135015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResUnit-F"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306135015-vs4ozrx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306134812-bjzn4k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306134812-bjzn4k8","updated":"20260306135242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里的残差连接组件单元总共包括了两种不同的类型，分别是带T和带F的一个是内部"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"加上了"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"残差连接，另一个就最最基本的CBS的两个叠加罢了并"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"没有"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内部的跳转结构。"}]},{"ID":"20260306093151-d3sfely","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093151-d3sfely","updated":"20260306144733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.3.SPPF结构"}]},{"ID":"20260306135427-zi5jcvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135427-zi5jcvu","updated":"20260306135445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个结构是在SPP网络结构上面进行修改后得到的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20260306135611-5j5d8o5","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306135611-5j5d8o5","updated":"20260306135803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260306135411-38ihec9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135411-38ihec9","updated":"20260306135612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306135422-nissmgu.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"SPPF"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306135654-4l77raq","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306135654-4l77raq","updated":"20260306135803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260306135609-rwkad28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135609-rwkad28","updated":"20260306135654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西就是使用了多种不同形态的池化操作，这些池化操作的卷积核是不一样大小的，最后生成的特征图尺度也是各不相同的。"}]},{"ID":"20260306135654-wkmywef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135654-wkmywef","updated":"20260306135738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后我们将池化的东西和之前最开始的东西完全融合在一起注意是concat的合成，最后经过卷积处理得到最后的特征图片。"}]},{"ID":"20260306135739-99rhlro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135739-99rhlro","updated":"20260306135803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西结合了不同尺度的特征，将他们拼接在了一起，应该比较好一些把。"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306144733-f1h3xki","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260306144733-f1h3xki","updated":"20260306144733"}},{"ID":"20260306093209-6z3vf65","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260306093209-6z3vf65","updated":"20260306144724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.颈部网络架构"}]},{"ID":"20260306135852-4d6qrd2","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306135852-4d6qrd2","updated":"20260306140025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260306135839-pdapbj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135839-pdapbj7","updated":"20260306135852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306135839-7cuxxxr.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"FPN+PAN\n"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306135940-9zd73k0","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306135940-9zd73k0","updated":"20260306140025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260306135850-70880w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135850-70880w4","updated":"20260306135940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左边这个图片就展示了YoLoV5中在颈部特征融合部分，他的FPN和PAN的融合结构图片。"}]},{"ID":"20260306135940-1klny98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135940-1klny98","updated":"20260306135959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要和之前的普通的FPN+PAN结构做好比对，如下图所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260306135959-s2xs0v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306135959-s2xs0v7","updated":"20260306140025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 428px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306140013-k5qwrd9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 428px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306140100-ci3gsqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306140100-ci3gsqm","updated":"20260306140355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其实蛮简单的就是不断地进行上下采样，融合图片特征罢了。左边是进行上采样，右边是进行下采样的处理。他的输入是主干网络的输入，输入的是三种不同尺寸的特征图，用来检测不同尺寸的物体大中小三种类型的物体。"}]},{"ID":"20260306140407-5gdtk9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306140407-5gdtk9f","updated":"20260306140423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不过这个结构和yoloV4基本差不多，看上去没啥区别的样子。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144724-x0ydlvw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260306144724-x0ydlvw","updated":"20260306144724"}},{"ID":"20260306134340-uki7i9h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134340-uki7i9h","updated":"20260306144717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.回归检测头部分"}]},{"ID":"20260306140909-m3ta35f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306140909-m3ta35f","updated":"20260306140958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在之前我们使用的边界框回归主要是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的那种类型的，我们的输出为偏移量和缩放量等事情。"}]},{"ID":"20260306140958-btnitxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306140958-btnitxl","updated":"20260306141025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在在YoloV5之中我们更新了，已经不再使用之前的那种方式了。"}]},{"ID":"20260306141025-lwjp0rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306141025-lwjp0rs","updated":"20260306141043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOv5 通过引入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"scalexy"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对中心坐标偏移计算进行了调整，公式变为："}]},{"ID":"20260306141052-0gmef0b","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306141052-0gmef0b","updated":"20260306141147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\n\\begin{align*}\nb_x \u0026= \\left( \\sigma(t_x) \\cdot scale_{xy} - \\frac{scale_{xy} - 1}{2} \\right) + c_x \\\\\nb_y \u0026= \\left( \\sigma(t_y) \\cdot scale_{xy} - \\frac{scale_{xy} - 1}{2} \\right) + c_y\n\\end{align*}\n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306141203-42yf0yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306141203-42yf0yp","updated":"20260306141355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们知道经过sigmoid函数之后的数据范围在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(0,1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时这里令"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Scale_{xy}=2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因此里面这个东西的数据范围为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(-0.5,1.5)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。预测框中心bx的范围变为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":" (cx−0.5,cx+1.5)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"by"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同理为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(cy−0.5,cy+1.5)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"}]},{"ID":"20260306141203-uwhlhg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306141203-uwhlhg1","updated":"20260306141454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子就允许预测框的中心坐标偏移到网格单元之外，消除边界效应。"}]},{"ID":"20260306142923-gzt8yfk","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306142923-gzt8yfk","updated":"20260306142919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260306142919-rbvgohx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142919-rbvgohx","updated":"20260306142919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 442px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260306142919-bgpwnca.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 442px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260306142051-3xtjqli","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260306142051-3xtjqli","updated":"20260306142923"},"CalloutType":"TIP","CalloutTitle":"Tip","CalloutIcon":"💡","Children":[{"ID":"20260306142056-ox20e65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142056-ox20e65","updated":"20260306142107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么什么是边界效应呢："}]},{"ID":"20260306142108-44u9a4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142108-44u9a4i","updated":"20260306142518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前传统的方法也就是YOLOV3的那种方法有个非常严肃的要求，我们的方框中心您，必须和物体的中心完全配合。"}]},{"ID":"20260306142518-866umpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142518-866umpe","updated":"20260306142830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么举个例子哈，现在有一个物体，假设他的真实x坐标为4.05，但是他的大部分主体仍然是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(3,4)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的格子之中，其中心仅仅是稍微跨出了格子0.05的小距离，根据当时的要求这个物体应该是由3号格子做检测任务，那么我们嫁给它带入到公式之中得到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"σ(tx)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"bx−cx"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"4.05−3"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1.05"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。但是sigmoid最大输出为1，并永远到不了1 ，因此没有八法，只能让"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"t_x"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取一个极大值，最终输出的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"b_x=3.999999"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260306142838-ro4umd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142838-ro4umd0","updated":"20260306142841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就导致了："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"公式天生就没法表示真实的中心位置，只能强行把预测值拽回自己的格子范围内，硬生生制造了无法消除的定位误差"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306134353-e1ywefp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134353-e1ywefp","updated":"20260306144717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.1.正负样本"}]},{"ID":"20260306142948-bzfecx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306142948-bzfecx5","updated":"20260306144130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里的正负样本匹配同之前的存在比较大的差距，在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之中每个对于N个物体仅仅只有N个正样本。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144131-krvkqmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144131-krvkqmj","updated":"20260306144714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"判定宽高比"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果宽高比类似那么进入正样本的筛选环节，这个步骤为初筛正样本。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144224-v4j8qx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144224-v4j8qx0","updated":"20260306144717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后再使用之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"IOU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"判定真正的正样本，现在并不仅仅只有一个了而是每个物体最多四个。也就是说一个真实框最多可以同时匹配多个检测头的anchor。并不仅仅是真实框中心落到的网格才能作为正样本。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144451-i6f8q0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144451-i6f8q0z","updated":"20260306144513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样一来就筛选出来了真正的正样本了。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144513-90un09n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144513-90un09n","updated":"20260306144649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是说两部筛选法，先找到宽高比合适的，再寻找IOU适配的，这来给你个同时匹配的东西就是正样本"}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-61bl37l","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-61bl37l","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-6ngkqpq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-6ngkqpq","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-txo1yby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-txo1yby","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正样本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：「步骤 1 筛选出的合格 anchor」 + 「步骤 2 筛选出的合格网格」的组合，全部都是正样本。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-6udzc6k","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-6udzc6k","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-6kqq1pd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-6kqq1pd","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-11lcs7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-11lcs7n","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举个例子：一个 GT 匹配了 2 个合格 anchor，又匹配了 4 个合格网格，最终这个 GT 会有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2×4=8"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​个正样本，是传统规则的 4-8 倍。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-2rm3xvh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-2rm3xvh","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-o8zu3bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-o8zu3bc","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正样本会参与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分类损失、置信度损失、框回归损失"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的全部计算。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-rlazpwt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-rlazpwt","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-gksps2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-gksps2x","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"负样本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：所有没有被选为正样本的 anchor，全部都是负样本。"}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-lmfhz44","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-lmfhz44","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-o0mq6s5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-o0mq6s5","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-f1s5cbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-f1s5cbw","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"负样本只参与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"置信度损失"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的计算，不计算分类和回归损失。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306144658-ke5eaxy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-ke5eaxy","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260306144658-eilrvy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306144658-eilrvy2","updated":"20260306144658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"忽略样本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLOv5 的忽略样本极少，只有一种情况：anchor 和 GT 的 IOU 超过了上限阈值（默认 0.7），但没被选为正样本的 anchor，会被忽略，不参与任何损失计算"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306134405-jpdikd9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260306134405-jpdikd9","updated":"20260306150240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.损失函数"}]},{"ID":"20260306093244-wiuogb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306093244-wiuogb7","updated":"20260306145035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和之前的一样，这里的损失函数也是多种函数的集合体："}]},{"ID":"20260306145035-ll6zv3l","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306145035-ll6zv3l","updated":"20260306145130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\text{Total loss} = λ_{box}\n​\n ×Box Loss+λ_{cls}\n​\n ×Cls Loss+λ_{obj}\n​\n ×Obj Loss"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306145139-aa9dqi9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,2],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|||","id":"20260306145139-aa9dqi9","style":"text-align: center;","updated":"20260306145139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"权重系数（默认值）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"损失类型"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对应任务"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通俗理解"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\lambda_{\\text{box}}=0.05"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"边框回归损失"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"框画得准不准"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生画的框和标准答案差多少"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\lambda_{\\text{cls}}=0.5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分类损失"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物体类别认对了没有"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生认的物体和标准答案差多少"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\lambda_{\\text{obj}}=1.0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"置信度损失"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个位置有没有物体"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生判断 “有 / 无物体” 错没错"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306145149-uo353fa","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306145149-uo353fa","updated":"20260306145402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"% 总损失函数\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\begin{split}\n\\mathcal{L}(\\text{object}) \u0026= \\lambda_{\\text{coord}} \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\left( 2 - w_i \\times h_i \\right) (1 - \\text{CIoU}) \\\\\n\u0026- \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\left[ \\hat{C}_i \\log(C_i) + (1 - \\hat{C}_i) \\log(1 - C_i) \\right] \\\\\n\u0026- \\lambda_{\\text{noobj}} \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{noobj}} \\left[ \\hat{C}_i \\log(C_i) + (1 - \\hat{C}_i) \\log(1 - C_i) \\right] \\\\\n\u0026- \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\sum_{c \\in \\text{classes}} \\left[ \\hat{p}_i(c) \\log(p_i(c)) + (1 - \\hat{p}_i(c)) \\log(1 - p_i(c)) \\right]\n\\end{split}\n\\end{equation*}\n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306145537-dimjgza","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260306145537-dimjgza","updated":"20260306145913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260306145550-xmijctv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306145550-xmijctv","updated":"20260306145645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前传统的IOU主要是判定重合度也就是仅仅考虑到重合面积的问题，并不考虑中心距离等问题，因此这里作者在CIOU增加了中心距离的一些相关说辞。"}]},{"ID":"20260306145645-ikq0281","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306145645-ikq0281","updated":"20260306145739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其核心为：在IOU的基础之上，额外惩罚中心距离远，和长宽比不符的情况，使得指标可以满足“重叠、中心、形状”三个维度"}]},{"ID":"20260306145742-ssk9zez","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306145742-ssk9zez","updated":"20260306145840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\text{CIOU}=IOU - \\frac{ρ^2(b,b^{gt})}{c^2}-\\alpha v"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306145913-ovga8m2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20260306145913-ovga8m2","style":"text-align: center;","updated":"20260306145913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"公式部分"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号解释"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活化比喻"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\text{IoU}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基础交并比（重叠面积 ÷ 总面积）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个框叠在一起的面积有多大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\frac{\\rho^2(b, b^{gt})}{c^2}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中心距离惩罚项："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\rho^2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：预测框中心"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和 GT 框中心"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"b^{gt}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的欧氏距离平方；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c^2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：能包围两个框的最小矩形的对角线长度平方（归一化项）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个框的中心离得越远，这一项值越大，CIoU 越小（扣分越多）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\alpha v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长宽比惩罚项："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\alpha"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：权重系数（平衡中心惩罚和形状惩罚）；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"v = \\frac{4}{\\pi^2} \\left( \\arctan\\frac{w^{gt}}{h^{gt}} - \\arctan\\frac{w}{h} \\right)^2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（衡量长宽比差异）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预测框的长宽比例和 GT 差得越多，这一项值越大，CIoU 越小（扣分越多）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260306145356-d4ql1z8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306145356-d4ql1z8","updated":"20260306150240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.1.边框回归损失（Box Loss）"}]},{"ID":"20260306145446-s1ds0pg","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306145446-s1ds0pg","updated":"20260306145458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{equation*}\n\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{box}} = \\lambda_{\\text{coord}} \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\left( 2 - w_i \\times h_i \\right) (1 - \\text{CIoU})\n\\end{equation*}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306145458-x7uacno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306145458-x7uacno","updated":"20260306150035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让预测框在位置、大小、形状上更贴合真实框，适配 YOLOv5 的跨网格框回归设计，主要是用来判定边框绘制的准不准。"}]},{"ID":"20260306150049-as54k3s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306150049-as54k3s","updated":"20260306150242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.2.正样本置信度损失（Obj Loss for Positive Samples）"}]},{"ID":"20260306150118-6va4ulm","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306150118-6va4ulm","updated":"20260306150128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{equation*}\n\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{obj-pos}} = - \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\left[ \\hat{C}_i \\log(C_i) + (1 - \\hat{C}_i) \\log(1 - C_i) \\right]\n\\end{equation*}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306150128-5frtem9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306150128-5frtem9","updated":"20260306150209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个和之前的也是几乎一样的，使用二元交叉熵仅仅对正样本进行计算看看该位置是否存在物体。"}]},{"ID":"20260306150209-o92d2xo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306150209-o92d2xo","updated":"20260306150348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.3.负样本置信度损失（Obj Loss for Negative Samples）"}]},{"ID":"20260306150245-r4ajg3k","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306150245-r4ajg3k","updated":"20260306150255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{equation*}\n\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{obj-neg}} = - \\lambda_{\\text{noobj}} \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{noobj}} \\left[ \\hat{C}_i \\log(C_i) + (1 - \\hat{C}_i) \\log(1 - C_i) \\right]\n\\end{equation*}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306150255-2ych2f4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306150255-2ych2f4","updated":"20260306150348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样的也是和之前一样通过二元交叉熵对负样本进行计算，判定该位置是否存在物体，使用一个权重系数防止对该损失函数的学习过大。"}]},{"ID":"20260306150348-50mgjj9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260306150348-50mgjj9","updated":"20260306150454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.4.分类损失（Cls Loss）"}]},{"ID":"20260306150406-xk41sas","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260306150406-xk41sas","updated":"20260306150413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{equation*}\n\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{cls}} = - \\sum_{i=0}^{K \\times K} \\sum_{j=0}^{M} I_{ij}^{\\text{obj}} \\sum_{c \\in \\text{classes}} \\left[ \\hat{p}_i(c) \\log(p_i(c)) + (1 - \\hat{p}_i(c)) \\log(1 - p_i(c)) \\right]\n\\end{equation*}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260306150425-kuyo9ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306150425-kuyo9ay","updated":"20260306150441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 BCE，仅对正样本计算，让模型准确识别物体类别。"}]},{"ID":"20260306150439-cqb7aup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260306150439-cqb7aup","updated":"20260306150454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后就得到了一组向量罢了。"}]}]}